trong>: Time for a &quot;paw-some&quot; massage! Let skilled kitty technicians knead those capybaras' worries away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/d5f8b0f96113ab19333b39bceebc45d5.poster.avif?t=1755573554\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/d5f8b0f96113ab19333b39bceebc45d5.webm?t=1755573554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/d5f8b0f96113ab19333b39bceebc45d5.mp4?t=1755573554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<i>And more activities to unlock!</i> Rack up glowing reviews from your clients, expand your services, and watch your resort shine!\u2728</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Dream Space!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the boss! Decorate every floor of your resort however you like\u2014cozy cottages, fancy suites\u2026 the choice is yours! Decorate more stunning rooms to attract more capybaras (and maybe you can unlock some quirky new furniture!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/1ce2431cd59d8a38caf0845f261677c9.poster.avif?t=1755573554\" width=400 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/1ce2431cd59d8a38caf0845f261677c9.webm?t=1755573554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/1ce2431cd59d8a38caf0845f261677c9.mp4?t=1755573554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph