hly while you\u2019re off conquering the world (or your inbox).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/de11f818413b3ee79bbe9c71f46d2d2b.poster.avif?t=1755573554\" width=794 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/de11f818413b3ee79bbe9c71f46d2d2b.webm?t=1755573554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438860/extras/de11f818413b3ee79bbe9c71f46d2d2b.mp4?t=1755573554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play While You Work!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Capybara\u2019s Happy Life</i> sits cutely on your desktop! Resize it, move it, and manage your empire while tackling other tasks. Multi-task like a pro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Build?</strong> Don\u2019t just daydream\u2014grab your hard hat and let\u2019s get building! \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\ud83d\udc96</h2>",
